    "production_assessment": [
      "Codex exchange_depth wraps only outer observed capability transaction, forwards exact args/kwargs to original nested Git boundary and restores depth in finally. Existing capability admission/failure/cleanup stays unchanged.",
      "Pi BridgeClient adds explicit interpreter -B after existing prefix args, before actual script. No executable, environment, shell, process containment, request or authority widening. Default and -I private actual-import regressions cover no-bytecode.",
      "Cold diagnostic upload now selects attempted success or failure with !cancelled; skipped/cancelled remain excluded. No-files ignore avoids a secondary upload error; qualification/report emission predicates remain success-only.",
      "Cold source status diagnostic uses SHA256 of complete raw status; bounds inventory and emitted entries; emits plaintext path only for immutable tracked members, hashes unknown filenames, reads no file contents. Diagnostic collection errors are swallowed while original source refusal remains primary. Narrow _SourceCheckoutError limits cold sink projection to owner-produced source failures.",
      "Pi pre-refusal installed-after snapshot is retained before equality/size refusal; failed membership still cannot create worker-result or qualified observation. Bootstrap sink validates closed source diagnostic fields/path digest and keeps original exception/cleanup behavior.",
      "No new dependency, authentication flow, network, credential persistence, raw stderr/exception echo, banned crypto primitive, permissions or qualification bypass introduced."
    ],
